CREATED:20260501T204023Z
DESCRIPTION:ADF Debuts\nProgram: ... and\, or... by I-Ling Liu & I am\, he
 re\; Here with us\; Where we find ourselves by Stacy Matthew Spence\nThis
  performance features live music!\nRunning time: 60 minutes\, including o
 ne intermission\nTickets: $30\nTickets are purchased through Duke Univers
 ity's Box Office.\n\nPost-Performance Discussion on Tuesday\, June 23 at 
 7:30 pm.\n\nI-Ling Liu Website: http://portaly.cc/liuiling610.greenmatchw
 orks\nStacy Matthew Spence Website: Instagram.com/stacymspence\n\nThis pr
 ogram brings together I-Ling Liu and Stacey Spence\, former members of Bi
 ll T. Jones/Arnie Zane Company and Trisha Brown Dance Company\, respectiv
 ely\, in their ADF choreographic debuts. Taiwanese choreographer I-Ling L
 iu presents ... and\, or...\, a 25-minute duet on the subject of "decisio
 n making" which explores the conditions and choices for establishing rela
 tionships while searching for the difference between pushing the boundary
  and overstepping it. Stacey Spence presents three works: a solo\, I am\,
  here\, a duet\, Here with us\, and a quartet\, Where we find ourselves\,
  created in collaboration with dancers and musicians. These pieces explor
 e ideas of self\, impulse\, and sharing. How do we find ourselves? How do
  we find our place? How do we find each other?\n\nPhoto Credit: I-Ling Li
 u Photo by Sugawara Kota & Stacy Matthew Spence Photo by Elyssa Goodman\n
 _________\n\nADF offers a 20% discount to Duke employees and $20 tickets 
 to Duke students (restrictions apply). To access your discount\, just log
  in with your Duke Net ID at tickets.duke.edu.
DURATION:PT1H
